  "instructions": [
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together peanut butter, honey, and kosher salt until smooth.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together Greek yogurt and lime juice until combined.",
    "Add the peanut butter mixture to the yogurt mixture and stir until smooth.",
    "Fold in chopped peanuts and short-grain brown rice.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 10 minutes.",
    "Once chilled, fill 4 glasses with crushed ice and spoon the peanut butter mixture on top.",
    "Garnish with fresh mint leaves and serve immediately."
